      }</script><style type="text/css" id="jam_theme">:root{--itchio_ui_bg: #282828;}body{background-color: #000000;}.jam_page_wrap{color: #222222;background-color: #000000;font-family: Lato,Lato,LatoExtended,sans-serif;font-size: 100%;--itchio_border_radius: initial;--itchio_link_color: #9a2982;--itchio_border_color: #e5e5e5;--itchio_button_color: #9a2982;--itchio_button_fg_color: #ffffff;--itchio_button_shadow_color: #8d1c75;--itchio_button_border_color: #8d1c75;--itchio_button_hover_color: #a2318a;--itchio_button_active_color: #95247d;background-image: url('https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4MzIzNTA5LnBuZw==/original/hj7aQt.png'); background-repeat: repeat; background-position: 50% 0%}.jam_body{border-radius: var(--itchio_border_radius,0);}.view_jam_page h1,.view_jam_page h2,.view_jam_page h3,.view_jam_page h4,.view_jam_page h5,.view_jam_page h6{}.view_jam_page .jam_body,.view_jam_page .grid_outer{background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1);}.view_jam_page .jam_body{box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px transparent;}.view_jam_page .grid_outer .itch_footer{border-top: 1px solid #d9d9d9 !important;background-color: #e5e5e5;}.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_text,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .game_count,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .footer_submissions{color: #666666 !important;}.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_platform,.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_genre,.view_jam_page .game_grid_widget .game_cell .game_author a,.view_jam_page .grid_outer .powerd_by{color: #8c8c8c !important;}.view_jam_page .header_tabs .community_activity{background-color: #e5e5e5;color: #222222;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item{color: #8c8c8c !important;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item:hover,.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .filter_item.active{color: #666666 !important;border-color: #9a2982 !important;}.view_jam_page .jam_filter_picker .divider{color: #666666;}:root {
  --my-string: "Voting Ends In";
  --primary-colour: #9a2982;
  --secondary-colour: #581049;
  --pale-colour: #F8EBFF;
}

.custom-footerimg{max-width:20% !important;}

img {
  max-width: 315px !important;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

table {
  border-collapse: collapse;
  border: none !important;
  width: 100%; /* optional: makes it stretch full width */
}

/*Main Page*/

html::before {
  content: "";
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 1;
}

body {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}



.stats_container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
}

.stat_box {
  text-align: center;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .view_jam_page .jam_header_widget .stats_container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  }
}


.header_tab[data-label="tab_view_jam_screenshots"],
.header_tab[href*="/screenshots"] {
  display: none !important;
}

.header_tab[data-label="tab_view_jam_feed"],
.header_tab[href*="/feed"] {
  display: none !important;
}

.jam_page_wrap {
  background-size: 50%;
}

.jam_body {
border-radius: 10px;
margin-top:20px;
}

.view_jam_page{
margin-bottom:50px;
}

/*Header*/

@media screen and (min-width: 800px){
.view_jam_page .jam_banner{max-width:500px;
margin-top:20px;}
}

.jam_banner {
  animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease-out;
}

@keyframes fadeUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}

.view_jam_page .jam_header_widget{
text-align:center;
color:#ffffff;
font-weight:bold;
border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--secondary-colour);
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--primary-colour), var(--secondary-colour));
}





.view_jam_page .jam_header_widget a {
  color: #ffffff;
text-decoration: underline;
}

.view_jam_page .jam_header_widget a:hover {
  text-decoration: underline; /* Optional: add underline on hover */
}

/*Hides the name of the jam*/
.jam_title_header{display:none;}

/*Puts the number joined in the middle of the header*/
.view_jam_page .jam_header_widget .header_columns{
display:inline;}
.stats_container{margin-bottom:20px;}

opacity: 0.9;
}

.stat_value{display:none;}/

/*Removes the overview / edit jam buttons*/
.view_jam_page .header_tabs{
display:none;
}

/*Submitter widget*/

.jam_submitter_widget{
border-radius: 16px;
}

/*Fixes the submission date*/
.jam_submitter_widget .date_data{
text-align:center;
}




/*Changes the text of the countdown*/
.countdown_label{
visibility:hidden;
}

.countdown_label:after {
  visibility: visible;
  color: var(--primary-colour);
  content: var(--my-string);
  font-weight: bold;
  animation: countdown-pulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;
}

@keyframes countdown-pulse {
  0%, 100% {
    opacity: 0.35;
    transform: scale(0.96);
  }

  50% {
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

/*Animates the join jam button*/
.view_jam_page .join_jam_btn{
animation: button-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite !important;
}

/*Animates the join jam button*/
.view_jam_page .join_jam_btn{
animation: button-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite !important;
}

/*Main HTML*/

/*Headers*/
.custom-header{
background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--primary-colour), var(--secondary-colour));
    border-radius:10px;
color:#fff;
text-shadow: 0px 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    padding: .8em;
text-align:center;
box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
}

.custom-header-sm{
    border: 1.5px solid #aaa;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: .5em;
text-align:left;
}

.custom-notice{
background-color:#f15353;
color:white;
border: 1.5px solid #8B0000;
border-radius: 5px;
padding: .5em;
text-align:center;
}

/*Alerts*/

.custom-alert{
background-color:#d10000;
padding:20px;
color:#fff;
border-radius:10px;
font-weight: bold;
text-align:center;
}

.custom-alerttext{
font-size: 24px;
}


/*Buttons*/

a[target=_votebutton] {
color:#fff;
background: var(--primary-colour);
border: 2px #fff;
border-radius: 60px;
padding:25px;
text-decoration: none;
font-size: 50px;
}

a[target= _votebutton]:hover {
color:#fff;
background: var(--primary-colour);
}


a[target=_button] {
color:#fff;
background: var(--primary-colour);
border: 2px #fff;
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 10px;
text-decoration: none;
font-size: 16px;
}

a[target=_button]:hover {
color:#fff;
background: var(--secondary-colour);
box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(88,16,73,0.3);
}

/*YouTube video bg*/
div.text-center{background:var(--secondary-colour);
border-radius:5px;}

/*Footer with GMTK logo*/
p.custom-footer{background:#000;
padding:2px;
text-align:center;
border-radius:5px;}


/*Animation*/

.owner_tools {
        background: none !important;
    }/* Content Styles */
    @keyframes button-pulse {
        from {
            transform: scale(1);
        }

        25% {
            transform: scale(1.2);
        }

        50% {
            transform: scale(1);
        }
    }


.custom-container {
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.custom-card {
border: 1.5px solid var(--secondary-colour);
  background-color: var(--pale-colour);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding-left: 16px;
padding-right:16px;
padding-top:16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease;
}

.custom-card-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.custom-icon {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  background-color: var(--primary-colour);
  border-radius: 50%;
  margin-right: 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
flex-shrink:0;
  justify-content: center;
}

.custom-icon img {
  width: 0px;
  height: 0px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.custom-card-title {
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 1.2em;
}

.custom-description {
  display: flex;
font-size:0.8em;
padding-top:10px;
font-weight:normal;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}


.custom-card details[open] summary {
  border-bottom-left-radius: 0;
  border-bottom-right-radius: 0;
}

.custom-card summary::-webkit-details-marker {
  display: none;
}



/* Fade in animation for content */
@keyframes fadeIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-5px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

details {
    border: 1px solid var(--secondary-colour);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: .5em .5em 0;
margin-bottom: 1em;
}

.custom-details-content {
  padding: 12px 16px;
  border-top: 1px dashed var(--secondary-colour);
  border-bottom-left-radius: 6px;
  border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
  animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in;
}

details[open] .custom-details-content {

  animation: details-open 0.3s ease forwards;

}

@keyframes details-open {

  from {

    opacity: 0;

    transform: translateY(-8px);

  }

  to {

    opacity: 1;

    transform: translateY(0);

  }

}

summary {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: -.5em -.5em 0;
    padding: .8em;

}


  .custom-checklist {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: sans-serif;
  }
  .custom-checklist li {
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  .custom-checklist details {
    border: 1px solid #888;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .custom-checklist summary {
    list-style: none; /* removes default triangle */
    cursor: pointer;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .custom-checklist summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none; /* removes triangle in Chrome/Safari */
  }
  .custom-checklist summary::before {
    content: "☐  ";
  }
  .custom-checklist details[open] summary::before {
    content: "☑  ";
  }
  .custom-checklist details[open] summary {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .custom-checklist details[open] {
    background: #4caf50;
    border-color: #4caf50;
  }
  .custom-checklist details[open] summary {
    color: white;
  } </style></head><body data-page_name="view_jam" class="locale_en jam_layout_widget layout_widget responsive no_theme_toggle" data-host="itch.io"><div class="small_logo gray jam_layout_header_widget header_widget base_widget" id="jam_layout_header_5407225"><a class="skip_to_main" href="#maincontent">Skip to main content</a><div class="primary_header"><h1 title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" class="title"><a title="itch.io - indie game hosting marketplace" href="/" class="header_logo"><span class="visually_hidden">itch.io</span><img class="full_logo" width="775" height="199" alt="itch.io logo &amp; title" src="https://static.itch.io/images/logo-black-new.svg"/><img class="minimal_logo" width="262" height="235" alt="itch.io logo" src="https://static.itch.io/images/itchio-textless-black.svg"/></a></h1><div class="header_buttons"><a href="/games" data-label="browse" class="header_button browse_btn">Browse Games</a><a href="/jams" data-label="jams" class="header_button jams_btn">Game Jams</a><a href="/developers" data-label="developers" class="header_button developers_btn"><span aria-hidden="true" class="icon icon-upload"></span>Upload Game</a><a href="/devlogs" data-label="devlogs" class="header_button devlogs_btn">Developer Logs</a><a href="/community" data-label="community.home" class="header_button community.home_btn">Community</a></div><form action="/search" class="game_search"><input class="search_input" type="text" required="required" name="q" placeholder="Search for games, jams, tags or creators"/><button aria-label="Search" class="submit_btn"><svg class="svgicon icon_search" width="18" height="18" stroke-width="3" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden stroke-linecap="round" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round" version="1.1"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_2150418"><a href="/login" class="panel_button" data-label="log_in" data-register_action="header">Log in</a><a href="/register" class="panel_button register_button" data-label="register" data-register_action="header">Register</a></div></div><div data-target="browse" class="header_dropdown"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default after_voting is_over has_banner" id="view_jam_3981380"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UyL2phbS8zOTAzMjQvMjczODgxNzIucG5n/original/BpDY7Z.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_4301402"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026">GMTK Game Jam 2026</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://gmtk.itch.io">Game Maker&#039;s Toolkit</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/GMTKJam">#GMTKJam</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box" title="10,593"><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/entries"><div class="stat_value">10.5k</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box" title="223,337"><div class="stat_value">223k</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026" data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active">Overview</a><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/entries" data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab">Submissions</a><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/results" class="header_tab">Results</a><a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/feed" data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_3228177"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-22 17:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-26 18:00:00</span>. <a href="/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h2 class="custom-header">GMTK Game Jam 2026</h2>
<div class="text-center"><iframe width="500" height="281" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/2alS2m5eOVY" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div>
<p>The GMTK Game Jam is an annual game making marathon, where individuals and teams try to make a game that fits a theme, in a super short time period.</p>
<p>This year&#x27;s theme was Count Down.</p>
<p>Each year thousands of games are submitted as designers improve their skills, flex their creative muscles, and try to get their game featured on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqJ-Xo29CKyLTjn6z2XwYAw" style="" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Game Maker’s Toolkit</a>.&nbsp;You can see (and play!) the <a href="https://gmtk.itch.io" style="font-size: inherit">past winners here</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<h2 class="custom-header">Top-Rated Games</h2>
<h2 class="custom-header-sm">Creativity - <a href="https://itch.io/jam/gmtk-jam-2026/results/creativity">See More</a></h2>
<table><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://aspect110.itch.io/bombit"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4OTMwOTY1LnBuZw==/315x250%23c/Bibt8n.png" loading="lazy"></a></td>
<td><a href="https://benjamdev.itch.io/picture-day"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NzkwNjMxLmdpZg==/original/naX%2FRd.gif" loading="lazy"></a></td>
<td><a href="https://cheesemug.itch.io/mock-mock"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NzcyMTIwLnBuZw==/315x250%23c/gLOq%2FH.png" loading="lazy"></a></td>
<td><a href="https://finngras.itch.io/time-of-death"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4ODY4NjQ0LnBuZw==/315x250%23c/c8KDXM.png" loading="lazy"></a></td></tr><tr></tr></tbody></table>
