<td><a href="https://placeholders.itch.io/007"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4ODI1Njk5LmdpZg==/original/I1MyVn.gif" loading="lazy"></a></td>
<td><a href="https://tanocollective.itch.io/research-and-detonation"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4ODIwMDgwLnBuZw==/315x250%23c/ruQq1K.png" loading="lazy"></a></td>
